  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 303.27 Sampling Requirements for New Groundwater Sources of Bottled Water. The supplier of water from a new groundwater source of bottled water shall sample and test in accordance with He-P 2105.03.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at part heading for Env-Dw 303) #11059, eff 4-1-16",
